# Line endings are LF in the repository and in every checkout (Windows included): tests compare generated files
# with committed ones, and shell scripts must not get CRLF. PowerShell reads LF scripts fine.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.gguf binary
# eval seed data is kept byte for byte (CSV with CRLF rows is part of a task)
evals/**/seed/** -text
